flowchart TD
  endpoint[Check the endpoint]:::check --> connect[Connect to PostgreSQL]:::extract
  connect --> server[Check server settings]:::check
  server --> replication[Check replication capability]:::check
  replication --> tables[Check tables and keys]:::check
  tables --> objects{Slot, publication and heartbeat}:::check
  objects -->|present| register[Register the source]:::query
  objects -->|created| register
  objects -->|missing| provision(Provision them, or ask the DBA):::transform
